Hi all,

Yes, another beta... I guess I should stop calling these betas as I 
anyway seem to just keep adding new features. The next one will be
0.6, I promise... :)

In addition to fixing a few bugs (one of them pretty serious) and 
misfeatures, this version has some new stuff:

    - A bit better docs

    - Parallel port PTT support

    - Save current mode at exit and restore at startup

    - New mode: PSK63

You can find it from:

    http://gmfsk.connect.fi/

